  "FriendlyName": "MKI Roads",
  "Description": "Asphalt roads laid like railway track: click the start, drag the end, and the road follows straights, curves and grades, 2 or 4 lanes wide (+ and - while placing). Intersections (2-, 3- and 4-way), a turnaround, truck depots and concrete road supports, under MKI Packs > Roads. Roads draw their own North American lane markings and lay their own vehicle paths, and vanilla street lights, barriers, railings, fences, walkways, foundations and truck stations snap to them. Costed as asphalt 8x4 foundations. Usable on its own; MKI Bridge uses it for road construction.",
